<title>USA: ITT confirms Hilton offer to buy company.</title>
<headline>ITT confirms Hilton offer to buy company.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Corp said on Monday it had confirmed an unsolicited offer made by Hilton Hotels Corp to buy it.</p>
<p>The company said management and the board of directors will consider the offer and make a recommendation to its shareholders within no more than 10 business days.</p>
</text>
